# Starting values and numerics (setup plan step 9, 2026-11-09). pitzSource: the pitzDaily tutorial as it ships, run 60
# SIMPLE iterations (its results at t = 60). pitzTarget: the same mesh, bare (its physics files taken away). Physics > Setup
# sets the target up as Internal flow and starts it from the other case's results: the case is picked from the list of
# cases with results, the step says which time it starts from. The Run page runs the Starting values step (mapFields)
# before simpleFoam: the cells take the other case's values, the inlet keeps the setup's condition. Writing the setup again
# brings 0/U back to the setup's own (merged with the field as it was before mapFields, not with mapFields' output).
# A run of 20 iterations stops short of converging: the Run page offers Robust, one click switches the numerics and runs
# again.
budget p95 80 max 600
shell cp -r "$FOAM_TUTORIALS/incompressible/simpleFoam/pitzDaily" $SB/ws/pitzSource && cd $SB/ws/pitzSource && sed -i 's/^endTime .*/endTime 60;/; s/^writeInterval .*/writeInterval 60;/' system/controlDict && bash -c '. "$WM_PROJECT_DIR/etc/bashrc" > /dev/null 2>&1; blockMesh > log.blockMesh 2>&1 && simpleFoam > log.simpleFoam 2>&1'
shell mkdir -p $SB/ws/pitzTarget/constant && cp -r $SB/ws/pitzSource/constant/polyMesh $SB/ws/pitzTarget/constant/ && mkdir -p $SB/ws/pitzTarget/system && printf 'FoamFile { version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object controlDict; }\napplication simpleFoam;\nstartTime 0;\nendTime 10;\ndeltaT 1;\nwriteControl timeStep;\nwriteInterval 10;\n' > $SB/ws/pitzTarget/system/controlDict
open $SB/ws/pitzTarget
click nav:physics
wait-until page Physics
wait 10
click su-tmpl#1
wait 10
assert log simulation.ini template = internalFlow
assert log simulation.ini numerics = balanced
click su-step#4
wait 5
assert text Start from
assert widget su-start#2
click su-start#2
wait 3
assert log simulation.ini start_from = mapFields
click su-map-case
wait 3
click text:pitzSource
wait 5
assert text Starts from pitzSource at t = 60
screenshot $OUT/01_start_from_case.png
click su-step#6
wait 5
assert text Numerics
assert widget su-num#0
click su-it
key A ctrl
enter 20
wait 3
screenshot $OUT/02_solver_numerics.png
click su-step#7
wait 5
assert text Nothing to fix
click su-check-run
wait-until page Run
wait 10
assert text Starting values
assert text mapFields: another case's last results onto this mesh
click run-go
wait-until job running timeout 30
wait-until job finished timeout 300
assert log log.mapFields End
assert not log log.mapFields FOAM FATAL
assert log log.simpleFoam End
assert not log log.simpleFoam FOAM FATAL
note the cells are mapFields' (no setup mark), the inlet still the setup's condition
assert log 0/U internalField   nonuniform
assert not log 0/U Written by Q-Continuum
shell cd $SB/ws/pitzTarget && grep -aA3 "^    inlet$" 0/U | grep -q surfaceNormalFixedValue && touch inlet_kept.txt
assert file inlet_kept.txt
assert file .qc-setup/0.before/U
wait 5
note 20 iterations: not converged, so the Run page offers Robust
wait-until widget run-robust timeout 30
assert text It ran all its iterations
screenshot $OUT/03_offer_robust.png
click run-robust
wait-until job running timeout 60
wait-until job finished timeout 300
assert log simulation.ini numerics = robust
assert log system/fvSchemes bounded Gauss upwind
assert log log.mapFields End
assert log log.simpleFoam End
screenshot $OUT/04_robust_run.png
click nav:numerics
wait-until page Numerics
wait 5
assert text Robust numerics, from Physics > Setup
screenshot $OUT/05_numerics_banner.png
note writing the setup again: 0/U is the setup's own once more
click nav:physics
wait-until page Physics
wait 5
click su-step#4
wait 3
click su-start#0
wait 3
click su-step#7
wait 5
click su-check-run
wait-until page Run
wait 5
assert log 0/U Written by Q-Continuum
assert log 0/U internalField   uniform
assert not file system/mapFieldsDict
